{"id":"219f53fb10f5fa92","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-open-cover.md","title":"Open Cover","display":"df-open-cover — Open Cover","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-open-cover","aliases":["58-df-open-cover","Open Cover","58-df-zfc-top-open-cover"],"display":"df-open-cover — Open Cover","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-open-cover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-open-cover</span><span>Open Cover</span><span>58-df-zfc-top-open-cover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-open-cover — Open Cover"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(C,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S\\)</span> (open-cover predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{OpenCover}_S(C,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land C\\subseteq\\tau\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup C\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{OpenCover}_S(C,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land C\\subseteq\\tau\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup C\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Open cover: family of open sets whose union contains <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span></li>\n<li>Subcover: subset of cover still covering <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span></li>\n<li>Compactness is the downstream assertion that every open cover has a finite subcover.</li>\n<li>Lebesgue number lemma: every open cover of compact metric space has positive Lebesgue number</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Willard, General Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate; see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{OpenCover}_S(C,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land C\\subseteq\\tau\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup C","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1069,"backlinks":[{"id":"84062f4afec5c913","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S$ (open-cover predicate; see [[58-df-open-cover]])"},{"id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-open-cover.md]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-274","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[58-df-open-cover]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-904","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-open-cover.md|58-df-open-cover]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["815e63e5071e7b58"]}